                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Rick Yazwinski",
                        "email": "rickyaz@meta.com",
                        "username": "ryazwinski"
                    },
                    "message": "openbmc-test-automation was failing.. my prev approach was to add a \"trusted json reader\" without the 500 element limitation, but @ed@tanous.net suggested bumping the limit.  There is discussion about refactoring this area to be 1 session per file."
